JSON FORMATTING RULES:
- Use proper commas between ALL array elements
- Use proper commas between ALL object properties  
- NO trailing commas before closing brackets
- Ensure all quotes are properly closed
- Must be valid JSON that can be parsed

KEYWORD EXTRACTION RULES:
- HIGH_CONFIDENCE: Words/phrases indicating definitive presence of condition
- MEDIUM_CONFIDENCE: Words/phrases indicating possible/suspected condition  
- LOW_CONFIDENCE: Words/phrases indicating absence/normal findings
- Extract ONLY words/phrases actually present in the text
- Use exact medical terminology from the text
- If condition not mentioned, use generic terms like ["not mentioned", "no reference", "not addressed"]
- Provide exactly 3 keywords per confidence level
- Use lowercase for consistency
